---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy | HangulEdu" description="HangulEdu keeps your progress in your own browser. No account, no cookies, no tracking.">
  <section class="wrap sec wrap--medium prose">
    <h1 class="t-h1">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="t-meta">Updated 28 October 2026</p>
    <h2 class="t-h2">What this website stores</h2>
    <p class="t-body">The letters you mark as known are saved in your browser's local storage under the key <code>hanguledu.letters.v1</code>. They never leave your device: there is no account, no server-side database and no cookie. Clear your progress at any time with the "Clear my progress" button on the home page, or by clearing this site's data in your browser.</p>
    <h2 class="t-h2">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="t-body">This website does not use analytics or advertising trackers. Links to Google Play carry a tag naming the page you came from, so we can see which pages lead to app installs; Google handles that data under its own policy.</p>
    <h2 class="t-h2">Fonts and audio</h2>
    <p class="t-body">Korean text is set in Noto Sans KR, loaded from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address when it serves the font. The Korean audio is synthesized speech (Google Cloud Text-to-Speech) and is served from this website.</p>
    <h2 class="t-h2">The Hangul Hero app</h2>
    <p class="t-body">The app has its own privacy policy, linked from its store page.</p>
    <h2 class="t-h2">Contact</h2>
    <p class="t-body">Questions: see <a href="https://vicsotheme.com/">vicsotheme.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
